  "question": {
    "text": "The rate constant for the first order decomposition of a certain reaction is described by the equation:<br />\r<math> <mrow> <mtext>&nbsp;log&nbsp;</mtext> <mtext>k&nbsp;</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>s</mtext> <mn>-1</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>14.34</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>1.25</mtext> <mo>×</mo> <msup> <mtext>10</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msup> <mtext>&nbsp;K</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>T</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br />\r&nbsp;At what temperature will its half-life period be <math> <mrow> <mtext>256 min</mtext> </mrow> </math>?"
  },
